    "body": "fix on issue/1489-rest-pocket-param · PR #1817 (draft, head f4c9f1ea6) · pinned by crates/app/tests/rest_pocket.rs (the_rest_pass_cuts_only_the_corners_posts_and_matches_its_golden, read_against_the_simulated_roughing_pass, the_group_is_an_undoable_edit_and_the_project_file_keeps_it, a_previous_tool_that_is_not_larger_is_refused_by_name_at_the_edit_and_the_retool, values_and_strategies_the_rest_pass_cannot_run_are_refused_by_name, mcp_sets_refuses_undoes_and_saves_the_group) and operation::rest_op_tests · merges at the next cut. The page group is #1815. The stock-simulation reading found that the inner leg of each corner ring feeds over cleared floor (#1816) and that 2 of the 4 corner plunges per level touch rest material at the rim (the entry is #1490's).",
